# ==============================================================================
# Chat-Codex 根目录防护规则 (.gitignore)
# 严格杜绝任何本地运行态沙盒、凭据数据库、编译缓存与环境配置入库
# ==============================================================================

# 1. 活跃运行态沙盒与浏览器 Profile (受保护数据，严禁入库)
sub-instance-*/
gui-app-profile/
master-seed-profile/
cloned-profile-*/
*profile*/
.runtime/
.codegraph/

# 2. 本地私有配置与环境变量
.env
.env.*
.env.local
*.local.json
runtime.local.json
!config.example.json

# 3. 编译中间产物、对象文件与依赖目录
node_modules/
**/target/
target/
src-tauri/target/
WebChat-Assistant/src-tauri/target/
handoff-core/src-tauri/target/
artifacts/
dist/
build/
out/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyd

# 4. 浏览器缓存、崩溃转储与 SQLite 凭据库
Crashpad/
Cache/
Code Cache/
DawnGraphiteCache/
GPUCache/
GrShaderCache/
ShaderCache/
Service Worker/
IndexedDB/
Local Storage/
*.sqlite*
*.db
*.db-*
*.db-journal
*.ldb

# 5. 日志与临时调试文件
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
*.tmp
*.bak
inspect_live/
vss_*_link/

# 6. 二进制与可执行文件过滤 (仅保留根目录桌面独立客户端)
*.exe
!/chat-codex-studio.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.pdb
*.d

# 7. 操作系统与 IDE 专属配置
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.user
